  <item>
    <title>韩国｜“旅行或旅居，最重要的是找到自己的地图”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6654265a4efbc0c3dc500398</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6654265a4efbc0c3dc500398</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 27 May 2024 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一次性聊聊韩国</span><strong><span>最热门的（3+1）个城市。</span></strong><br><span> </span><br><span>今年春天，我们分别前往韩国不同地区赏樱。Sunny去了济州岛旅居，陈一日和尾巴在大邱与釜山旅行，我们都在三月末里看到了满开的樱花。所以本期周休巴士将会开往韩国，带大家听一听海边盛放的樱花、春夜里被路灯照亮的夜樱、黄昏下的樱花道路。</span></p><span></span><p><span>樱花是春日限定，在樱花落尽之后，我们想聊聊在韩国这几个城市里的私藏地图：济州岛最好看的几片海，釜山的艺术与电影，首尔的文具购物路线。</span></p><span></span><p><span>无论去任何城市旅行或旅居，最重要的都是构建一张属于自己的地图。</span><br><span> </span><br><span> </span><strong><span>🚌 行程表</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="108">1:48</a> 济州岛</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2434">40:34</a> 大邱</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2936">48:56</a> 釜山</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3822">1:03:42</a> 首尔</span><br><span> </span><br><span>🕴</span><strong><span> 本期导游</span></strong><br><span>Sunny </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/632424a0000000002303846f?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=615668c3000000000201d69e&amp;apptime=1716790692" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/632424a0000000002303846f?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=615668c3000000000201d69e&amp;apptime=1716790692"><span>🍠 Sunny睡醒啦</span></a><br><span>陈一日 </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/615668c3000000000201d69e?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=615668c3000000000201d69e&amp;apptime=1716790677" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/615668c3000000000201d69e?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=615668c3000000000201d69e&amp;apptime=1716790677"><span>🍠 陈面条</span></a><br><span>尾巴 </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5679e82d5e87e76ebbaf9922?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=615668c3000000000201d69e&amp;apptime=1716790714" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5679e82d5e87e76ebbaf9922?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=615668c3000000000201d69e&amp;apptime=1716790714"><span>🍠 小尾巴mori</span></a><br><span>* 本期提到的点可以在导游主页中🔍城市名找到喔</span><br><span> </span><br><span> </span><strong><span>🎵 BGM</span></strong><br><span>DooPiano - Ditto</span><br><span>10cm - 봄눈 (Live)</span></p>]]></description>
