  <item>
    <title>京都｜“红叶季不去热门点，在鸭川边发发呆也很好”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65717399d6e0ff5822d2f0ae</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65717399d6e0ff5822d2f0ae</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 07 Dec 2023 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>11月时赶在红叶季的开端，我们前往京都短暂地旅行了五天。在这座遍地都是古迹的城市里，我们经历了许多个「被这座城市所感动」的时刻。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目将会带领大家重温我们在京都的五天，从阴雨连绵到夕霞满天的鸭川，像电影中一样精致排布在京都许多小巷里的店铺们，到一步一景有着纯粹匠人精神的神社与庭院。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们并没有去大热的清水寺、三千院或者是岚山，而是在诸多小众的清净地中，找到了这座城市真正的魅力所在。</span></p><span></span><p><span>那么，就随我们一同坐上前往京都的列车，走进秋色正浓的红叶季，在京都过一个秋天。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span><br><span> </span><br><span> </span><strong><span>🍁 提到的地点</span></strong><br><span> </span><br><span> </span><strong><span>【 ☕️ 咖啡 】</span></strong><br><span>📍WIFE &amp; HUSBAND | 咖啡店+野餐，需提前预约</span><br><span>📍Roastery DAUGHTER &amp; Gallery SON | 只贩售豆子，2楼是杂货店</span><br><span>📍COYOTE | 萨尔瓦多咖啡</span><br><span>📍Weekenders Coffee | 本店只有周末开门，分店工作日开门</span><br><span>📍blend kyoto | 自选拼配豆手冲</span><br><span> </span><br><span> </span><strong><span>【 🥢 餐厅 】</span></strong><br><span>📍殿田丼物 | 亲子丼乌冬面</span><br><span>📍酒场 井仓木材 | 白天木材店，晚上立吞居酒屋</span><br><span>📍Slō | 法式面包三明治店</span><br><span>📍石烧地鸡町屋 | 烧鸡专门店，需提前预定</span><br><span> </span><a href="http://xhslink.com/Luxwix" data-url="http://xhslink.com/Luxwix"><span>📍市川屋 | 季节水果三明治</span></a><br><span>📍千丸屋京汤叶 | 豆腐专门店，需提前预定</span><br><span>📍Me Me Me Coffee | brunch&amp;三明治</span><br><span> </span><a href="http://xhslink.com/Yzdjix" data-url="http://xhslink.com/Yzdjix"><span>📍Luca | 日式法餐季节コース</span></a><span>，需提前预约</span><br><span> </span><a href="http://xhslink.com/gdajix" data-url="http://xhslink.com/gdajix"><span>📍うめぞ | 和菓子</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【 ⛩ 景点&amp;神社 】</span></strong><br><span> </span><a href="http://xhslink.com/lnNwix" data-url="http://xhslink.com/lnNwix"><span>📍源光庵</span></a><br><span> </span><a href="http://xhslink.com/tnEwix" data-url="http://xhslink.com/tnEwix"><span>📍贵船神社</span></a><br><span> </span><a href="http://xhslink.com/lpIwix" data-url="http://xhslink.com/lpIwix"><span>📍无邻庵</span></a><span> | 需提前预约</span><br><span>📍南禅寺</span><br><span>📍冈崎神社 | 兔子神社</span><br><span>📍御金神社 | 求财</span><br><span>📍下鸭神社 | 水占卜</span><br><span>📍河井宽次郎纪念馆</span><br><span> </span><br><span> </span><strong><span>【 👛 逛店 】</span></strong><br><span>📍仓日用商店</span><br><span> </span><a href="http://xhslink.com/IUUwix" data-url="http://xhslink.com/IUUwix"><span>📍D&amp;Department</span><br><span>📍新风馆 | TN / Beams / 本と野菜</span><br><span>📍惠文社</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵 BGM </span></strong><br><span>上妻宏光 - 時の旅人</span><br><span>長谷川智樹,美野春樹,岩永知樹 - Hello!</span><br><span>miwa - あたりまえに</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎤 主播&amp;嘉宾</span></strong><br><span> </span><strong><span>陈一日 </span></strong><span>| </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/615668c3000000000201d69e?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=615668c3000000000201d69e&amp;apptime=1701933628" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/615668c3000000000201d69e?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=615668c3000000000201d69e&amp;apptime=1701933628"><span>🍠 陈面条</span></a><strong><br><span>Sunny</span></strong><span> | </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/632424a0000000002303846f?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=615668c3000000000201d69e&amp;apptime=1701933662" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/632424a0000000002303846f?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=615668c3000000000201d69e&amp;apptime=1701933662"><span>🍠 Sunny睡醒啦</span></a><strong><br><span>尾巴</span></strong><span> |</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/605581a70000000001001598?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=615668c3000000000201d69e&amp;apptime=1701933683" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/605581a70000000001001598?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=615668c3000000000201d69e&amp;apptime=1701933683"><span> 🍠 小尾巴的尾巴</span></a></p>]]></description>
